  "entity": "HCMv3.PayrollManagement.IndemnityPayRuleDetail",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>One step of an indemnity pay rule, by years of service — for example, a resignation after three to five years paid at half.</p><p>Not used at present: every payroll and report calculation passes no indemnity pay rule, so the indemnity cap always comes from the employee's <strong>Employee Group</strong>. These rules are saved and kept for reference.</p>",
